1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,999
一块太阳能板，只需要做一件事
A solar panel has only one job:

2
00:00:03,999 --> 00:00:06,916
一整天都转过去，正对着太阳
turn all day long to face the sun.

3
00:00:07,976 --> 00:00:09,980
可在《戴森球计划》里
But in Dyson Sphere Program,

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,446
一颗星球上铺满了成千上万块
a single planet is paved with thousands of them,

5
00:00:12,446 --> 00:00:15,067
恒星周围还飞着几十万张太阳帆
and hundreds of thousands of sails circle the star.

6
00:00:15,927 --> 00:00:18,401
每一块都在转。这么多东西
Every one of them is turning.

7
00:00:18,401 --> 00:00:20,710
游戏到底每一帧要算多少？
How much does the game have to compute each frame?

8
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:26,636
这一期，我们看怎么让一百万个东西，一起追着太阳转
This episode: how to make a million things track the sun at once.

9
00:00:28,936 --> 00:00:32,892
最直接的写法：每块板每帧在 CPU 上
The direct way: every panel, every frame, on the CPU:

10
00:00:32,892 --> 00:00:36,668
先找到太阳，转动底座，再把面板仰起来
find the sun, turn the base, tilt the face up,

11
00:00:36,668 --> 00:00:40,084
算出一个 4×4 矩阵，传给显卡
build a 4×4 matrix and hand it to the GPU.

12
00:00:40,644 --> 00:00:42,729
我在这台电脑上测了一下
I measured it on this machine:

13
00:00:42,729 --> 00:00:45,858
一百万块板，光算矩阵就要 46 毫秒
for a million panels the matrices alone take 46 milliseconds,

14
00:00:45,858 --> 00:00:48,539
每帧还得上传 61 MB 数据
and 61 megabytes have to be uploaded every frame.

15
00:00:49,199 --> 00:00:52,953
可这些板的变化，其实全都能从太阳位置推出来
Yet everything about how these panels change follows from where the sun is.

16
00:00:54,453 --> 00:00:57,539
那就把这段数学，搬进顶点着色器
So move that math into the vertex shader.

17
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:01,666
每块板只存一次：它在星球上的方向
Each panel is stored once: its direction on the

18
00:01:01,666 --> 00:01:04,585
加一个随机数，16 个字节
planet plus a random number, sixteen bytes,

19
00:01:04,585 --> 00:01:07,336
开局上传，之后再也不动
uploaded at the start and never touched again.

20
00:01:07,996 --> 00:01:13,985
每一帧，CPU 只发两个数：星球转到了哪，太阳在哪
Each frame, the CPU sends just two values: how far the planet has turned, and where the sun is.

21
00:01:13,985 --> 00:01:17,621
顶点着色器自己转底座、仰面板
The vertex shader turns the base and tilts the face on its own.

22
00:01:18,281 --> 00:01:21,552
转到夜晚的一侧，太阳落下地平线
On the night side, once the sun sets below the horizon,

23
00:01:21,552 --> 00:01:24,641
板子就平放下来，等下一次日出
the panels lie flat and wait for the next sunrise.

24
00:01:26,741 --> 00:01:29,863
太空里的太阳帆更极端：几十万张
Out in space, the solar sails go further: hundreds of thousands,

25
00:01:29,863 --> 00:01:31,978
每一张都在绕着恒星转
each orbiting the star.

26
00:01:32,538 --> 00:01:35,002
它们甚至什么都不用存
They don't need to store anything at all.

27
00:01:35,002 --> 00:01:39,739
只用编号算出哈希，就能定出轨道、半径和起始角
A hash of each sail's index fixes its orbit, radius and starting angle,

28
00:01:39,739 --> 00:01:43,340
再按开普勒定律，越靠里的转得越快
and by Kepler's law, inner orbits run faster.

29
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,467
位置就是编号和时间的函数
Position is just a function of index and time.

30
00:01:46,467 --> 00:01:50,907
这里的一百零四万八千五百七十六张帆，只用一次绘制
These one million forty-eight thousand five hundred seventy-six sails take a single draw call.

31
00:01:51,567 --> 00:01:53,802
据社区 Mod 作者的分析
According to a community mod author's analysis,

32
00:01:53,802 --> 00:01:56,595
《戴森球计划》也是用一次程序化绘制
Dyson Sphere Program also draws all the distant sails

33
00:01:56,595 --> 00:01:58,411
画出所有远处的太阳帆
with one procedural draw call.

34
00:02:00,511 --> 00:02:02,384
戴森壳的六边形也是一样
The hexagons of the Dyson shell work the same way.

35
00:02:02,384 --> 00:02:06,129
社区 Mod SphereOpt 把它们改成实例化
The community mod SphereOpt switched them to instancing:

36
00:02:06,129 --> 00:02:08,536
每层一次绘制，而不是每块壳一次
one draw call per layer instead of one per shell.

37
00:02:09,196 --> 00:02:11,757
在一颗有 5240 块壳的戴森球上
On a sphere with 5,240 shells,

38
00:02:11,757 --> 00:02:14,703
作者测到帧率从 18 提到了 85 左右
its author measured the frame rate going from 18 to about 85.

39
00:02:16,403 --> 00:02:18,849
还有一招是不画、少画
Another move is to draw less, or nothing.

40
00:02:18,849 --> 00:02:22,424
离得近的太阳帆，游戏画成实心模型
Sails up close are drawn as solid meshes;

41
00:02:22,424 --> 00:02:25,247
远处的，只是一张平面贴片
far away, they're just flat sprites.

42
00:02:25,907 --> 00:02:30,403
SphereOpt 也给框架和节点加了细节层级和视锥剔除
SphereOpt also added level of detail and frustum culling for frames and nodes:

43
00:02:30,403 --> 00:02:33,158
戴森球不在画面里时，帧率大幅上升
when the sphere is out of view, the frame rate jumps.

44
00:02:34,658 --> 00:02:37,712
四期下来，招式其实只有几种
Four episodes in, there are really only a few moves:

45
00:02:37,712 --> 00:02:41,530
局部规则、空间网格、数据和逻辑分开
local rules, a spatial grid, data kept apart from logic,

46
00:02:41,530 --> 00:02:44,394
再把能算的都交给 GPU
and everything computable handed to the GPU.

47
00:02:45,054 --> 00:02:47,377
下一期，我们把它们合在一起
Next time, we put them all together.
